Word lists for the Turkish Wordle, generated by tools/wordle/build-words.py.

guesses.txt is derived from the Zemberek-NLP lexicon
  (https://github.com/ahmetaa/zemberek-nlp, commit 037202c, morphology/src/main/resources/tr/)
  Copyright 2018 Ahmet A. Akın, Mehmet D. Akın — Apache License 2.0.

answers.txt is the subset of guesses.txt that also occurs in the 25 000 most frequent Turkish words of
  hermitdave/FrequencyWords (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, commit 525f9b5, content/2018/tr/tr_50k.txt),
  content licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). answers.txt is therefore
  distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
